_:N4dc45b8c2d454b08b62f84eb7271f040 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://github.com/corrado877/CognitiveBiasOntologies/blob/main/CognitiveBiasOntologies#AmbiguousStimulus> .
